{"prefix": "------------------------------- MODULE mathd_algebra_123 -------------------------------\nEXTENDS Naturals, TLAPS\n\nTHEOREM mathd_algebra_123 ==\n    \\A a, b \\in Nat :\n        (a > 0) /\\ (b > 0) /\\ (a + b = 20) /\\ (a = 3 * b) => (a - b = 10)", "fragment": "BY SetExtensionality", "suffix": "\n=============================================================================\n", "theorem_name": "mathd_algebra_123"}